    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec165c32ada8970b4f56bae8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我无论如何都想成为\n“华丽一族”真正的骄傲……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a66938f4a3adbbd61b0177a0696f255d9bb0ac8b935990da2b4082957a5ea87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b50d2a3dcc78f0041f8a34f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英里CS结束后・最耀眼的光芒",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ec7b3bdc0879e06fa421a574b967226197237dc4059a9630e33477b62397cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085316.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45cfe92394c8c14a9390cfaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“华丽一族”的千金小姐・第一红宝石。\n此家族有个使命，就是在所有领域缔造成就，\n展现家族至高无上的威望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78e5640b9d3dc6ec3766dce747369d157f56e7844bf1b428f646b9327080aae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f302d8c98dd40e97b66f61e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竞赛世界当然也不例外。\n她的祖母是远近驰名的赛马娘，\n母亲也曾在名声显赫的比赛立下伟大功绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3cfd1f70181cf368722b21e4560470c648c89cb00642018a42f79dc1f2a23b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d5599c1f17684553f77ece",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她身负重任，须跑出足以代表\n家族金科玉律的表现并获胜。\n训练员发誓，将陪她一同扛起她肩负的期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9d40169ce96312ac597f4bdb77c7e0b825a28247e449028355d5c1a6398bae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8798e6ad95dae21c5716791b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "备受世间瞩目的第一红宝石举行了记者会。\n即使大拓太阳神因爱上她的跑姿而突然闯入，\n她也毫不动摇──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e63b16b24ad77c46cbb64745b777a939a7a0f3587f276dfd2e0d9d4fb6ee1a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf3027418d8cd54057f5270",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她宣布往后将遵循家族的轨迹，\n迈向三后冠路线。\n“华丽一族”的崭新历史，现在揭开序幕──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b05d79510ed8ae01dfd7f952c3fc2c9dd37d98216b0fcbdab87e1feabd433a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a870653c4bb590fdaa7d3734",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "727a89b30bf5fd60c73e9b63eebfe56b6760464106372685d62d57ac9026ad6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085400.json",
      "json_path": [
