      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3870124afbb26ba8fa5b8a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0532a35d687596904869767b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员与第一红宝石一同前往她的宅邸。\n在那里，他临时被告知将与被称为\n传奇赛马娘的第一红宝石母亲见面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fac9211d315d76ed7348126f90dfb77336f7f1985324838c912241e992de09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:094b5f47c14e586968ca3478",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2954fecd41a01b131ff037",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在仿佛能够看透一切的母亲面前，\n训练员有些瑟缩。不过他还是挺起胸膛，\n努力地表现出签约训练员该有的举止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e95cb1f40a10d709a51466cc72bdd23ef3b2aad116a687f36ec89909ecbeb4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25de2a70d9c905e6b6b9e54b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff6baa0f4a3a7482a37737e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "母亲将女儿托付给训练员，\n期许他能发掘出最耀眼的光芒，\n并且对女儿以锻炼身体为主的行程表达关心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f365dc21440cebad78bf0642a90507cef673297fb2f0b9dff9a460b453d6138a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5ead9da52cd73a4ec4153c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44016cdea6dfabd045662672",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回到学园后，第一红宝石提起母亲当年的事迹，\n并且以“华丽”一词来概括。\n在那个当下，训练员窥见她的眼中闪过光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "852a833b033a6ed89fc3e864cc56cb4a68621cc73d7046c9a387c500089189ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a707fedbf6f6d664081beede",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5df190d99eccb2727c7a31c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员感觉到，她之所以想走三后冠路线，\n并不只是为了遵循家族的轨迹，\n还包含对母亲的憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb43071c5090b221e9dc8b58f2899d746ba5db3ad598abd5c875c8cad0b93663",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f3eae7097778794d716d72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "华丽的最高杰作",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb78f56fa032fd4d36b6d45a95b055dcaebf036e6539d185b9e90d1506665d4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc396ae87c6c1446b7f8103",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石脚踏实地进行着训练。\n由于她显得相当慎重，训练员怀疑\n她的身体状况是否有疑虑，于是出口询问。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c051123f49c0d751832213c3236ca2a9bbecfc05be55b8217f38993875edfb71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93c75b1772a4acc20cf60463",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来第一红宝石的双脚天生形状异常。\n年幼的她曾梦想借由奔跑展现家族的骄傲，\n却差点因此而丧失存在意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ec8aba5183664e9381c681e1e9ba0efb82aec495c0d0a8db6cb7f776ac7e8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53745e3a808976914f73ad70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当时她的父母用尽所有方法，\n尽心尽力地帮助她。多亏了父母，\n她才练就挺得过激烈比赛的体魄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f78538ac83f89e79c179a36cb363e5e39004a033679f1ba9ca895561c157096",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfa7418d8825bf70062475fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石发誓，\n不会让“华丽一族”的功绩止于这一代。\n并且，她还要缔造成果来回报那份大恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "013cbc1878c1b850b0b5d890a951edd627f9b34149bd30f95af80aedf5a1be08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71c184a094e94e70215690b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，训练员未能对神色黯淡的第一红宝石开口。\n他在心中发誓要向大拓太阳神看齐，主动亲近她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "833d6c836c23f3a02d0faa7a595f375d90e6f2c3f3777b96d03e46711c99a460",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:336cc03b75f2dd4d5660c09e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，不能松懈",
      "source_fingerprint": "3991816c0abbd6f2d9edcbf7b4a61e8b8908066f7c1fe9eeb75f63275f948f55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2540421e9981ddffd1ad0ea5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:904bef3af4cc8ff6ce49b078",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石努力地进行中距离训练，\n但迟迟看不到成效。训练员开始思考，\n或许她其实比较适合跑短距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7160f2ba99a0dec2b6a1133ed3397dfbd0e845c12294d47a6b33fee14413907",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e47f98a7c5ad6f60a2dd3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:400b180f845703d79a41b902",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，第一红宝石也注意到了自己的资质问题。\n然而，为了替母亲雪耻，\n挑战“橡树大赛”是绝不容许退让的要务。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22ad56ee2e29c073d30505071fc803b0c0048cbabaf32790de3747bd2915185",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cf2f023f18507d5cec0e400",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40972a2ee8087c9382bf8d0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她得走上主流，成为不辱家族之名的选手。\n另外，也要回报父母让自己能够跑步的恩情。\n为此，她打算以自主训练弥补不足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b06a2a2ad504513299109bd60ce58fb0c036991ec3ac5051aa208c41876a49e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9130a1bfc7949f106ac289c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b4211b165f575a89ccb546",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹在此时来访。为了重要事物\n而努力的第一红宝石令她感同身受。\n她也祈祷第一红宝石能够实现心愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed02694d4351023ff9dae75d9fc0bc6903e60eb92507783f19a4b9d54d577317",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f33134a2099a5410e26efd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec3f73a16c7864c9539a241",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石却说，\n自己胸怀的不是心愿，而是意志。\n反复摸索的日子就这么持续到“橡树大赛”那天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "714340a69cee6ae121c5538b31f865974ab2504a5220a2da57cf34d65d3412e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e79d82a8ebcabb49cdf137",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "专注看向前方",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe07fb16fc25a285b745e13ebb03dde7751004e7bddd8df541230b80ed0556f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e1defc385484f2b677b451",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训期间，第一红宝石努力地要克服\n中长距离。此时，目白高峰心血来潮地\n决定参加集训，并征求并跑练习的对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d6a0e9cb11872f2b1f294c5c6085b27660181ccb0bed0d5e2a4554cd56c5c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8e6380741f3621a9d267ef0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石自告奋勇与她并跑练习。\n为了找出自己该走的路，她以2400米的\n比赛赌一把，结果却败北……",
      "source_fingerprint": "630d710701ec922298da0817c481393971ae065e929ab7b42b34bd81594a4349",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6eef78ff188bb6106126255",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，训练员提议再比一次。\n他告诉第一红宝石，她那惊人的尾段加速\n正是专属于她的“光芒”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6279d7d89fcb7054b8ead94a91cfe4a7aedd05f98ee82cdf2dda53354e1c9c39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56c3631becc9fbcfdf9be338",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人以1600米第二次对决。\n虽然第一红宝石以些微差距输了，但她也让\n目白高峰认为她的尾段加速不容小觑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0247931add4ee670164d957ec2640ea8f05f7a89cfc62eb3ff521dbe34d39d45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b8517b9287cb6dde1b14f1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过此事，原本深信只有称霸主流才能\n达成使命的她改变了想法。为了在最适合自己\n的道路上展现光芒，她决定转战短距离路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f619a9a8a8c47caa72389640823118470f1e45ffbe5f55216d1ec08f9939b1e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    }
  ]
